{"title":"이대로 멈출 순 없다","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=keijB/hAd4E855OL/dJJ3ztb0JeZ1n9CbNyFCHK&filename=th3","synopsis":"사상 최악의 막장 쓰레기 문제아 학교, \n정문여상에서 살아남기!\n\n자타공인 날라리 소연은 폭력 사건 주동자로 지목되어\n똥통 학교인 정문여상에 전학을 가게 된다.\n\n친어머니 집에 얹혀살게 된 소연은 \n자신을 둘러싼 모든 부당한 대우에 분노한다.\n\n설상가상으로 전학 첫 날, 왕따 폭행으로 전학 왔다는 \n‘오해’가 퍼지고, 상상도 못 할 만큼 저질인 양아치들과 \n보이지 않는 암묵적인 규칙이 소연을 압박해온다.\n\n민주와 엮여 엉겁결에 오합지졸 배구부까지 가입하게 되어 \n자연스레 온갖 사건에 휘말리지만...\n\n소연의 ‘오해’에 대해 쉽게 판단하지도 않고\n정면으로 부딪치는 친구들과 함께하며 \n점점 녹아들기 시작한다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":218,"change":{"type":"up","amount":55}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":214,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":224,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":253,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":226,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":228,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":245,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":222,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":245,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":213,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":214,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":200,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":209,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":198,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":180,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":288,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":249,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":185,"change":{"type":"up","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":190,"change":{"